# Review ownership for this repository.
#
# GitHub requests a review from these owners on any pull request touching a
# matching path. The entries gate a merge only while branch protection on the
# default branch requires review from code owners, which is a repository setting
# and not something this file can enable.
#
# A code owner must have write access or higher on this repository, including
# where the owner is an outside collaborator. GitHub ignores an entry naming an
# account without write access, without reporting an error.

* @RoshanakDavallou @Omidfatahi @yasermofatteh

